  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation on restoration and development of the Karen Blixen Museum in Nairobi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the establishment of a framework for the Danish-Kenyan cooperation on the restoration and development of the Karen Blixen Museum in Nairobi. The cooperation has three main aims, as agreed with the government of Kenya: 1) Preserving and restoring Blixen&apos;s original house; 2) Updating the Museum&apos;s overall presentation of Blixen&apos;s story with a view of increasing its present-day relevance using Blixen as a prism for engaging with issues of wider societal and developmental importance, and in connection to this; 3) Consider establishing a new visitors&apos; centre as a place to engage, 
learn, and inspire.</narrative>
  </description>
